{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 19:41:34.725934", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content=\"You are provided with the following network description and its current state:\\nNetwork Description: The network is an SDN star topology with one central switch and multiple edge switches.\\nEach host is connected to exactly one edge switch.\\nAll hosts share a single access subnet 10.0.0.0/24 and receive IP addresses from this range.\\nThe central switch is connected to every edge switch, forming a star topology (hub-and-spoke).\\nAll switches also participate in a management/control network 20.0.0.0/24.\\nAn SDN controller runs at 20.0.0.100 and all switches are configured to use this controller via OpenFlow (tcp:20.0.0.100:6633).\\nOVS switches: switch_0, switch_1, switch_2, switch_3, switch_4, switch_5, switch_6, switch_7, switch_8\\nHosts: host_1, host_2, host_3, host_4, host_5, host_6, host_7, host_8\\nTopology: (switch_1:eth0, host_1:eth0), (switch_2:eth0, host_2:eth0), (switch_3:eth0, host_3:eth0), (switch_4:eth0, host_4:eth0), (switch_5:eth0, host_5:eth0), (switch_6:eth0, host_6:eth0), (switch_7:eth0, host_7:eth0), (switch_8:eth0, host_8:eth0), (switch_0:eth0, switch_1:eth1), (switch_0:eth1, switch_2:eth1), (switch_0:eth2, switch_3:eth1), (switch_0:eth3, switch_4:eth1), (switch_0:eth4, switch_5:eth1), (switch_0:eth5, switch_6:eth1), (switch_0:eth6, switch_7:eth1), (switch_0:eth7, switch_8:eth1), (switch_0:eth8, switch_1:eth2)\\n\\nYour goal is to analyze the network condition and, if needed, use the available tools.\\nYou need to generate a troubeshooting diagnosis report.\\nThe report should reflect your assessment of the network's health, indicate any abnormal behavior you identify, and describe relevant findings based on your analysis.\\n\\nFocus on producing an informative and coherent diagnostic report derived from the network state.\\nDo not need to propose any solutions or remediation steps at this stage.\" additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='ae4fb093-cc47-4fcb-8412-b3c780074b8b'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
